      "mergeID": "6ac7e03d7c0205fa60c66bcd",
      "mergedPostDetails": "As many users are not in support of the use of generative AI in the creation of worlds and avatars and any assets for such, a requirement to disclose when it is used and an optional filter to exclude worlds using generative AI is in order.",
