      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate of several other highly upvoted feature requests:\n\n# Disclosure\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-an-ai-content-identifier-for-worlds-and-avatars\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/disclose-ai-generated-content-in-worlds\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/require-content-using-generative-ai-to-declare-it\n\n# Filters\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/filters-for-ai-generated-content\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/require-content-using-generative-ai-to-declare-it",
